Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:01.20,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:04.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.33,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:09.96,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:22.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:28.44,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:32.98,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:39.12,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:42.24,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.00,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.55,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:59.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:02.64,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:10.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:01.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:04.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.33,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:09.96,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.59,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:22.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:28.44,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:32.78,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:39.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:42.24,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.00,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.55,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:59.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:02.64,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:10.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:48.30,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:51.89,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:58.82,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:03.40,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:08.78,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:13.87,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:17.92,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:23.84,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:28.34,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:34.68,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:38.81,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:44.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:49.32,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:58.37,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:48.30,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:51.89,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:58.82,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:03.40,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:08.78,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:13.87,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:17.92,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:23.84,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:28.34,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:34.68,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:38.81,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:44.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:49.32,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:58.37,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't disappear like that! You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can you pick me a green one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous not to hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Dangerous...}For me? {old: We do?} {I know this isn't literal, but it obviously sounds better in English.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knew this many parents would bring their kids here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!{added -masat}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, okay. This looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What size are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around. {actually he says, "Rin, let me look at your back" but that will sound odd here, no?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where should I compare the sizes? {I know it's not literal, please reword it, maybe "hold it"}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't flap around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas, underwear, shirts, socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about skirts? All you have are pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're not allowed to wear skirts at the day-care center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Day-care center?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot! Tomorrow is Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there. Just bear with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. {because she can't go answer the phone}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is the Maeda family. {don't know how you answer phones in the US}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I am very sorry for your loss. {Check/edit, not sure if she's referring to the grandpa's death or something else?}{done}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please hold on one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, it's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:05:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Haruko. Sorry, I didn't ask for your cell number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, how do you enroll in a day-care center? {he's asking what the conditions are}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Day-care?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! You really brought Rin-chan home with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, are you sure that's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the time being?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I have to go back to work tomorrow. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, you can't just enroll her on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do something about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you ask me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now, you could ask at the city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing. {No, something on my side}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not now, Reina! This is an important conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.82,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have a temporary emergency day-care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary emergency day-care...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:50.41,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.90,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened? Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:56.90,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, Rin-chan, Rin-chan, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing. {No, something on my side}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done soon, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's impatient!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'm turning off the miso soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem busy, so I'll{ call you back lat}—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't many...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Suddenly, my commute has doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's nearby, but I can't get off work by 6. {Check}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.65,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. Let's play again next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks good, but the temporary day-care service is only for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, sorry{ 'bout that}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you sleeping over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The futon is strangely warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be going to day-care today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:51.35,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat! {overlapping}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat with your elbows on the table! {lol bad manner}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the day-care I'm taking you to now is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just until I decide on a place for you to officially attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's "officially" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doing things the proper way{properly}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My{\i0} hair is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me down! Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you embarrassed about the other kids seeing me carry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I'll leave her in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, have a nice day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be back until after dark, but I'll come as soon as I can. {check first half}{done}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky promise, swallow a thousand needles if I lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, cut my finger off. {I've never heard this phrase before, コンチクショー}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later. Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to pay attention to your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.93,0:10:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's circumstances and Grandfather's death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,aren't really things you'd care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only the lonely truth that you were left all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I'd abandon you, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for making you go through that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want to read?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, let's go to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I brought this. I'm getting a head start{ on something} today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I see. I'm off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beginning of the month and you're already working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not really. {http://s3.amazonaws.com/kym-assets/entries/icons/original/000/005/882/I%20lied.jpg?1305927805}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can pick a photo from this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, you have a call on line four
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,about the meeting for the private viewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!{added -masat}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello,{I'm here now. <- Who would ever say this in English when picking up the phone? No one. -Pie}{literally "Call superseded"} this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.{added -masat}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your jacket on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, it's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over. {old: Give it to me}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi. Thank you for doing business with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:14:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'm very sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I should be able to leave the office shortly. I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This day-care... is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are these potatoes? They look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a sauté! {Kinpira is a style of cooking. Editor, please help?}
