Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:38.91,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\1c&H000000&\1a&H60&\pos(378,424)\fs34\fnKristen ITC\frz-48.5}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand needles...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,swallowed! {This show is adorable.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I'll leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, your signature!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I probably don't need to worry about it, but what will happen if I get a girlfriend? {Lol foreshadowing}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, sorry{ 'bout that}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi. This was supposed to get shipped yesterday.{Kawachi? -masat}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's unusual for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.31,0:17:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already apologized to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'll give them a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, let's go out drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I can't today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow doesn't work, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Must be nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Keep running{ away} from the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It never ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how long I can keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, these are{ all} Rin-chan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:20:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is all we have, but her maternity book and important documents are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's just for a short time, raising a child can be very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really must be hardest on Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I'll just take a little look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Haha, }Her mouth is still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.98,0:20:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone seems to think you're some kind of villain. {Check}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But really, who's the bad one here... Masako-san? {check with last line}{done}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, you're sleeping over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-did I... Me?!{looooooooooooooooooooool}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.59,0:22:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. It's sweat, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me take off the sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I say it was sweat, too?!
